# Build artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/

# Dependencies
**/node_modules/

# EF Migrations (large, rarely need to read)
**/Migrations/

# Lock files
**/package-lock.json
**/yarn.lock
**/pnpm-lock.yaml

# Minified assets
**/*.min.js
**/*.min.css

# IDE / OS
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# Logs & temp
**/logs/
**/*.log
**/*.tmp

# Test results
**/TestResults/
**/coverage/

# Publish output
**/publish/
**/dist/

# Word / Office docs (not code)
**/*.docx
**/*.xlsx
**/*.pdf
